          "Hadith.1367 - Al-Fudayl ibn Yasar reported from him (Abu Abdullah (as)) who said:\n\"Indeed, the houses in which the Qur'an is recited during the night and where prayer is performed shine for the inhabitants of the heavens just as the stars of the sky shine for the inhabitants of the earth.\""
        ]
      }
